1
00:00:00,078 --> 00:00:02,314
Mental tempe katanya lemah...

2
00:00:02,314 --> 00:00:05,775
padahal tempe pernah menyelamatkan
nyawa tawanan perang!

3
00:00:05,775 --> 00:00:07,853
Saat Jepang menduduki Jawa,

4
00:00:07,853 --> 00:00:10,723
tawanan Belanda dan
Inggris terkapar disentri.

5
00:00:10,723 --> 00:00:13,255
Kedelai rebus pun tak bisa mereka cerna.

6
00:00:13,255 --> 00:00:14,833
Tapi tempe bisa...

7
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:17,069
jamurnya sudah mencerna kedelai duluan.

8
00:00:17,069 --> 00:00:19,225
Ilmuwan yang ikut ditawan menyimpulkan:

9
00:00:19,225 --> 00:00:21,529
banyak yang selamat berkat tempe.

10
00:00:21,529 --> 00:00:22,853
Awal Desember ini,

11
00:00:22,853 --> 00:00:24,422
UNESCO memutuskan:

12
00:00:24,422 --> 00:00:26,853
tempe jadi warisan dunia atau tidak.

13
00:00:26,853 --> 00:00:27,510
Follow,

14
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:29,971
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
